{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Mr. Hale, grab a chair. I've got the pharmacy refill list on the screen for Dr. Patel.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Um, login's spinning again. Sorry. We're doing your refills, Mr. Hale?",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (DOCTOR): The note says you want a stronger painkiller. That still true?",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (DOCTOR): Nurse, the med tab crashed. Read me what the pharmacy filled.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (NURSE): Naproxen five hundred— wait, no, I was on last year's line. The current list is naproxen two hundred fifty milligrams, one tablet by mouth twice a day, acetaminophen five hundred milligrams by mouth up to four times a day as needed, omeprazole twenty milligrams every morning, and lisinopril ten milligrams daily.",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (DOCTOR): Naproxen two fifty for you?",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (PATIENT): Five hundred.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): Say that once more? I clicked the wrong window.",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (PATIENT): Five hundred.",
  "[SEG0012] person_1 (NURSE): What they dispensed is two hundred fifty milligrams, one tablet by mouth twice a day. That's the bottle on the log.",
  "[SEG0013] person_2 (DOCTOR): You're swallowing two tablets, so five hundred twice a day?",
  "[SEG0014] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0015] person_2 (DOCTOR): Well, actually, no, I'm not raising the naproxen. Where does it hurt?",
  "[SEG0016] person_3 (PATIENT): Back.",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (DOCTOR): Low back or between the shoulders? Fan's loud, give it to me again.",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (PATIENT): Low.",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (DOCTOR): How long has the low back been like this?",
  "[SEG0020] person_3 (PATIENT): Years.",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (DOCTOR): Constant, or does it quit on you?",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (PATIENT): Constant.",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (DOCTOR): A number, zero to ten, today?",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (PATIENT): Seven.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (DOCTOR): Pain shoot down either leg?",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (DOCTOR): Numbness in the feet, or a leg that gives out?",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any change in bowels or bladder?",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (DOCTOR): Popup ate that. Bowels no, bladder no?",
  "[SEG0032] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (DOCTOR): Stiff when you get up?",
  "[SEG0034] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0035] person_2 (DOCTOR): How long till it eases off?",
  "[SEG0036] person_3 (PATIENT): Hour.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (DOCTOR): You taking the acetaminophen?",
  "[SEG0038] person_3 (PATIENT): Sometimes.",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (DOCTOR): One tablet of the five hundred, by mouth, when you do?",
  "[SEG0040] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (DOCTOR): Omeprazole twenty every morning for your stomach?",
  "[SEG0042] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (DOCTOR): Lisinopril ten each day for the high blood pressure?",
  "[SEG0044] person_3 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0045] person_1 (NURSE): Vitals from a minute ago. Blood pressure one thirty-eight over eighty-four, heart rate seventy-two.",
  "[SEG0046] person_2 (DOCTOR): Pressure once more? Blank allergy field was distracting me.",
  "[SEG0047] person_1 (NURSE): One thirty-eight over eighty-four, pulse seventy-two.",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any drug allergies, then?",
  "[SEG0049] person_3 (PATIENT): Sulfa.",
  "[SEG0050] person_2 (DOCTOR): Rash or swelling?",
  "[SEG0051] person_3 (PATIENT): Rash.",
  "[SEG0052] person_2 (DOCTOR): No oxycodone. I'm not prescribing it. This is your usual mechanical low back pain from the osteoarthritis on the chart for years, and an opioid is the wrong tool here. Take one naproxen two-fifty twice a day, not two, and keep the omeprazole with it.",
  "[SEG0053] person_3 (PATIENT): Fine.",
  "[SEG0054] person_2 (DOCTOR): If it doesn't settle, we might do a lumbar x-ray. Not ordering that today. Come back in six weeks.",
  "[SEG0055] person_3 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0056] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any bottles at home that aren't yours?",
  "[SEG0057] person_3 (PATIENT): Wife's.",
  "[SEG0058] person_2 (DOCTOR): Hers being what?",
  "[SEG0059] person_3 (PATIENT): Metformin.",
  "[SEG0060] person_2 (DOCTOR): Your wife's metformin is not your medicine. Leave it alone. Do you smoke?",
  "[SEG0061] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0062] person_2 (DOCTOR): Good. Nurse, send the four refills as written, naproxen at two fifty, acetaminophen, omeprazole, and lisinopril, and no oxycodone. Mr. Hale, if a leg gets weak or you can't pee, call, don't wait the six weeks. Parking out front was a mess, hope it wasn't you stuck behind that truck."
 ],
